<%# title Cover Letter %>
<main class="mw-cover">
    <div class="mw-cover-page pg1">
        <div class="mw-cover-sidebar pg1">
            <header class="mw-cover-alt-header">
                <h1>Matt<br/>Whitaker</h1>
                <h2>SR+ FRONT-END</h2>
            </header>
            <section class="mw-cover-contact">
                <h2><span>CONTACT</span></h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <span>
                            <b>phone</b> <br />
                            +123 4567 890
                        </span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span>
                            <b>email</b> <br />
                            hire@mattwhitaker.name
                        </span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span>
                            <b>website</b> <br />
                            mattwhitaker.name
                        </span>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </section>
        </div>
        <div class="mw-cover-content pg1">
            <div class="mw-cover-addressee">
                <h2><span>COVER LETTER</span></h2>
                <article>
                    <time><%= new Date().toDateString() %></time>
                    <h3>TO</h3>
                    <p>
                        HIRING MANAGER <br/>
                        Mr. Hiring Manager Guy
                    </p>
                    <address>
                        Company Name <br/>
                        5678 Maple Avenue <br/>
                        Springfield, IL 62711
                    </address>
                </article>
            </div>
            <div class="mw-cover-letter">
                <article>
                    <h2>PRINCIPAL FRONT-END ENGINEER</h2>
                    <p>Dear [Recipient Name],</p>
                    <p>I am excited to submit my application for the Principal Front-End Engineer position at [Company Name]. With over 12 years of experience in software engineering, particularly in front-end development and leadership, I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your team and help drive [Company Name]’s innovative projects forward.</p>
                    <p>Throughout my career, I have honed my expertise in front-end technologies and frameworks, demonstrating a strong proficiency in JavaScript, HTML, CSS, React, and Angular. My most recent role as a Senior Software Engineer (Full-stack) at [Previous Company] allowed me to lead numerous front-end initiatives, where I was responsible for engaging with UX teams, intaking designs, and meticulously planning work for the development team. This experience has sharpened my ability to translate complex designs into intuitive, user-friendly interfaces while maintaining a high standard of code quality.</p>
                    <p>I take pride in my leadership and mentorship capabilities, having spent the latter part of my career building and enhancing the front-end skills of other engineers. My role naturally evolved into a leadership position where I delegated tasks, provided training, and ensured the successful completion of projects. This transition has equipped me with the skills necessary to oversee the development process from concept to deployment effectively.</p>
                    <p>In addition, my experience with Behavior-driven Development (BDD) has been instrumental in ensuring that our code meets both technical and business requirements. By fostering a collaborative environment where developers, testers, and business analysts work together, I have consistently delivered solutions that are both robust and aligned with stakeholder expectations.</p>
                    <p>I am particularly drawn to [Company Name] because of its commitment to innovation and excellence in the tech industry. I am eager to bring my front-end expertise and leadership experience to your team, contributing to the development of cutting-edge solutions.</p>
                    <p>Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experiences align with [Company Name]’s goals.</p>

                    <p>
                        Sincerely, <br/>
                        <img /> <br />
                        Matt Whitaker
                    </p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>